129	    // `entries-create` is a bearer-required operation (not in
130	    // HeaderInterceptor.anonKeyOnlyFunctions) — seed a user access token
131	    // through the real AccessTokenProvider (backed by the faked secure
132	    // storage channel above) so the real header interceptor has one to
133	    // send.
