51	  /// Boundaries: "On opening Home/Chat, silently ensure one Chat Session
52	  /// exists (reuse the most recent from `chat-sessions-list`, else
53	  /// `chat-sessions-create` with no title)". A no-op once already
54	  /// [ChatReady] — `ChatScreen.initState()` calls this unconditionally on
55	  /// every mount, but a `lazySingleton` cubit may already be bootstrapped
56	  /// from an earlier visit.
57	  Future<void> init() {
