131	  /// [content] is blank once trimmed, or while [_isSending] is already
132	  /// true — this story never races two concurrent sends against the one
133	  /// in-memory session (Boundaries: no offline lock/composer-disable UI
134	  /// of its own exists yet, Story 6.3's job, so this guard is the one
135	  /// thing standing in for it here). Deliberately not keyed off any
136	  /// loaded message's persisted `streaming` status — a message restored
137	  /// from history/cache can legitimately carry that status without a
138	  /// send actually being in flight (I/O matrix: mid-stream drop).
139	  Future<void> sendMessage(String content) async {
140	    final trimmed = content.trim();
141	    if (trimmed.isEmpty) {
142	      return;
143	    }
